# Keep the build context small. The engine Dockerfile (deploy/bundle/Dockerfile)
# copies only media-ingest-c/{Makefile,src} and deploy/app/run.sh, but without
# this the context would still ship node_modules, the extractor venv, the console
# build and prior artifacts — tens of thousands of files for nothing.
**/node_modules
**/.toolchain
web/dist
**/dist
media-ingest-c/build
downloads
.git
.openhands
